{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"title":"Tracker","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L51"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker is a value. Build one where the app starts, start delivering its records, and either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass the tracker down or bind it to a task with "},{"code":"withTracker","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and read it anywhere inside with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())","withTracker(tracker) {","    Tracker.current.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Copies share one stream of records. A binding reaches the work run inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the child tasks it starts, but not callbacks a framework runs on tasks of its own, such as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"UI framework’s button actions: pass those a tracker."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" does nothing but accept the event, from any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thread: it reads the clock, captures the call site and the task’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":", and queues"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. A worker the tracker owns, which never runs on the main actor, does everything else, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the order events were tracked: the constraints’ check, the enrichers, the samplers, the consent,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a store’s writes, and publishing to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". No API runs that work on a caller’s thread. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" waits for the worker to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catch up; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" does too, then ends the records."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tracked events wait in memory, without a bound, until the worker reaches them. The queue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t be bounded without losing something it mustn’t: it also carries consent decisions and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the waits of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"type":"text","text":" can’t wait for room without blocking its caller."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without a store, records live in memory only, and records not yet delivered are lost if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process exits. A tracker given a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RecordStore"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivers what the store kept from earlier runs first, and writes each record to it once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"worker reaches it: a record is durable from then on, and one tracked moments before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process is killed, not yet reached, is lost."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker given "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s keeps a seeded fraction of the events they apply to, dropping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest before they are held, written or delivered and reporting them on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker given a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" delivers an event only once its category is granted, holding it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while undecided and dropping it when denied; one given none delivers every event."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/enriched(by:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/enriched(by:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A copy of this tracker whose events’ contexts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enricher"},{"type":"text","text":" also changes, for the code it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handed to."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","title":"enriched(by:)"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"title":"Sampler","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","title":"Trackers"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/finish()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/finish()","title":"finish()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Ends tracking: waits for the worker to handle every event already tracked, then ends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" after them, so a delivery sends what is still pending and completes. Events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked afterwards are dropped."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"finish"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/Records-swift.struct":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records of the events a tracker tracks, in the order tracked: what a delivery reads."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.struct","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Records","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Records","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"Tracker.Records","role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)":{"title":"init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:c